{"title":"Friday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/957985931/0/marginalrevolution~Friday-assorted-links.html","date":1781278664000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2026/06/09/nyregion/nyc-street-parking.html\" target=\"_blank\">Is there too much free parking in NYC?</a> (NYT)</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/gladwell/status/2064723834008146357?s=61\" target=\"_blank\">New Malcolm Gladwell book forthcoming on violence in America</a>.  Ready for pre-order.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.writingruxandrabio.com/p/manufacturing-requirements-are-killing?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1553777&amp;post_id=201462355&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Manufacturing requirements are killing gene and cell therapy</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. “<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/2f86dced-7a1c-432e-9988-0592ebb8ac25?syn-25a6b1a6=1\" target=\"_blank\">Long-term exposure to urban air pollution damages the heart even at the relatively low levels found in many developed countries, a cardiac imaging study in Canada has found.</a>” (FT)</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://scottsumner.substack.com/p/the-silent-revolutionaries?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2934833&amp;post_id=201159622&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjo0NzYxLCJwb3N0X2lkIjoyMDExNTk2MjIsImlhdCI6MTc4MTA5ODc5NiwiZXhwIjoxNzgzNjkwNzk2LCJpc3MiOiJwdWItMjkzNDgzMyIsInN1YiI6InBvc3QtcmVhY3Rpb24ifQ.tq1N9y2SMqkqSCuLEzYXlHBPBGyNNMfA65GWWZrmLwk&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Scott Sumner defends the Boomers</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ft.com/content/db75e347-b13b-4753-8130-6301bb55c040?syn-25a6b1a6=1\" target=\"_blank\">What went wrong with German trains?</a> (FT)</p>\r\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2026/06/10/science/humans-walking-veer-left-counterclockwise.html\" target=\"_blank\">Why do people wander in a counterclockwise direction?</a> (NYT)</p>\r\n<p>8. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/sebkrier/status/2065030790136602967\" target=\"_blank\">Seb Krier</a>: “Over the past few months I’ve been working on a very exciting project: a new $10m fund for research on multi-agent multi-principal AGI safety! Instead of focusing on single agent alignment and centralized control, we’re looking to support research focusing on multi-agent settings, mechanism design, cooperative AI, and coordination problems.”</p>\r\n<p>9. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/BBCBreaking/status/2065371245193900477\" target=\"_blank\">And the great David Hockney is gone…</a></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/06/friday-assorted-links-576.html\">Friday assorted links</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/957985931/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/957985931/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/957985931/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/9579